<template name="family">
  <view class="family-hero">
    <view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE TEAM, A LOT OF LOVE</view>
    <view class="hero-title">我们一起，慢慢长大。</view>
    <view class="muted">家里有 {{babies.length}} 位宝宝，{{members.length}} 位家人相伴。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-row">
    <view class="section-title">家里的小可爱</view>
    <button wx:if="{{owner}}" class="text-button" bindtap="openBaby">＋ 添加宝宝</button>
  </view>
  <view class="baby-grid">
    <view wx:for="{{babies}}" wx:key="id" class="baby-profile {{item.color}}">
      <image
        wx:if="{{item.picture}}"
        class="profile-avatar"
        src="{{item.picture}}"
        mode="aspectFill"
      />
      <view wx:else class="profile-avatar default-avatar">{{item.initial}}</view>
      <view class="baby-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <button wx:if="{{owner}}" class="baby-edit" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openBaby">
        修改名字和头像
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!babies.length}}" class="empty">先给宝宝取个名字、选张头像吧 ♡</view>
  <view class="section-row">
    <view class="section-title">家人列表 · {{members.length}}人</view>
    <button wx:if="{{owner}}" class="small-primary" bindtap="openInvite" disabled="{{busy}}">
      邀请家人
    </button>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="id" class="member-row">
      <image
        wx:if="{{item.picture}}"
        class="member-avatar"
        src="{{item.picture}}"
        mode="aspectFill"
        style="flex-shrink: 0"
      />
      <view wx:else class="member-avatar" style="flex-shrink: 0">{{item.initial}}</view>
      <view class="member-name" style="min-width: 0">
        <view>{{item.name}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.relation}}" class="muted footnote">{{item.relation}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.birthday}}" class="muted footnote">
          {{item.birthday.calendar === 'lunar' ? '农历' : '公历'}}{{item.birthday.leap ? '闰' :
          ''}}{{item.birthday.month}}月{{item.birthday.day}}日
        </view>
        <view wx:else class="muted footnote">生日未填写</view>
        <button
          wx:if="{{item.canEditAvatar}}"
          class="text-button"
          size="mini"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="chooseMemberAvatar"
          disabled="{{busy || demo}}"
        >
          修改头像
        </button>
        <button
          wx:if="{{item.canEditBirthday}}"
          class="text-button"
          size="mini"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="openBirthday"
          disabled="{{busy}}"
        >
          {{item.birthday ? '编辑生日' : '添加生日'}}
        </button>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{item.isOwner}}" class="owner-label">管理员</text>
      <button
        wx:elif="{{owner}}"
        class="text-button muted"
        size="mini"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="removeMember"
      >
        移除
      </button>
    </view>
    <view class="muted footnote">
      只有管理员能邀请和移除家人。邀请卡片24小时有效，仅供一人加入；移除后需管理员重新邀请。
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">家人怎么称呼你</view>
    <view class="inline-field">
      <input
        class="field"
        value="{{profileName}}"
        maxlength="12"
        data-field="profileName"
        bindinput="input"
      />
      <button class="text-button" bindtap="saveProfile" disabled="{{busy}}">保存</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card reminder-card">
    <view class="section-title">给我发微信提醒</view>
    <view class="muted">
      {{configured ? (subscribed ? '已记录你的授权，发送次数以微信可用额度为准。' :
      '开启后，可在有授权额度时接收任务及生日提醒。') : '尚未接入真实微信消息模板。'}}
    </view>
    <button class="soft" bindtap="subscribe">
      {{configured ? '订阅家庭提醒' : '查看提醒说明'}}
    </button>
    <view class="muted footnote">
      自动提醒约每5分钟检查一次；家人也可手动提醒。一次性订阅不是永久授权，普通小程序无法保证无限次自动推送。
      关注事项完成后通知关注者；生日提前3天上午10点起提醒所有家人，均需各自有可用授权。
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{birthdayMessages.length}}" class="card message-card">
    <view class="section-title">今天的生日提醒</view>
    <view wx:for="{{birthdayMessages}}" wx:key="id" class="message-line">
      <text>{{item.title}}</text>
      <text class="muted">{{item.label}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</template>
